%% Support articles for a fictional invoicing app.
%% {Id, Area, Title, Body}.
{<<"kb:refund">>, <<"billing">>,
 <<"Refund a payment">>,
 <<"Open the invoice, choose Payments, then Refund next to the "
   "payment. A full or partial refund goes back to the card used. "
   "Card refunds take 5 to 10 business days to appear.">>}.
{<<"kb:double-charge">>, <<"billing">>,
 <<"A customer was charged twice">>,
 <<"A double charge usually comes from a retried checkout. Check "
   "Payments on the invoice: if two payments share the same "
   "amount and day, refund the second one. Pending duplicates "
   "drop off within 3 days without a refund.">>}.
{<<"kb:export">>, <<"billing">>,
 <<"Export invoices as CSV">>,
 <<"Admins can export invoices from Reports, Export. Pick a date "
   "range and the CSV format. Exports over 10000 rows are sent "
   "by email.">>}.
{<<"kb:tax">>, <<"billing">>,
 <<"Set tax rates per country">>,
 <<"Go to Settings, Taxes and add a rate per country or region. "
   "A rate applies to new invoices only; existing invoices keep "
   "the rate they were issued with.">>}.
{<<"kb:password">>, <<"account">>,
 <<"Reset a forgotten password">>,
 <<"On the sign-in page choose Forgot password. The reset link "
   "is valid for 30 minutes. Admins can also send a reset link "
   "from Users.">>}.
{<<"kb:sso">>, <<"account">>,
 <<"Configure single sign-on">>,
 <<"SSO needs the Team plan. Upload your identity provider "
   "metadata in Settings, Security, then map the email "
   "attribute. Keep one admin with a password as a fallback.">>}.
{<<"kb:two-factor">>, <<"account">>,
 <<"Turn on two-factor authentication">>,
 <<"In Profile, Security, scan the QR code with an authenticator "
   "app and save the recovery codes. Admins can require "
   "two-factor for every user.">>}.
{<<"kb:webhooks">>, <<"integrations">>,
 <<"Receive payment webhooks">>,
 <<"Add an HTTPS endpoint in Settings, Webhooks. Each event is "
   "signed; verify the signature header. Failed deliveries are "
   "retried 5 times over 24 hours.">>}.
{<<"kb:api-keys">>, <<"integrations">>,
 <<"Rotate API keys">>,
 <<"Create the new key first, deploy it, then revoke the old key "
   "in Settings, API. A revoked key stops working at once.">>}.
{<<"kb:plans">>, <<"account">>,
 <<"Change your plan">>,
 <<"Upgrades apply at once and are prorated. Downgrades apply at "
   "the end of the billing period. SSO and audit logs need the "
   "Team plan.">>}.
